  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research irregular migration and migrant smuggling in Niger and Mali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to address a vital knowledge and operational gap in the Malian and Nigerien State responses to threats posed by migrant smuggling, especially in connection with organized transnational criminal networks.</narrative>
